                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2deee2f8-ffad-397f-94b5-71e139506ea2",
                        "entry_id": "f73c82d1-47b2-335e-9d1e-7974e9e85ca2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Ahnung/Gefühl dafür, was später sein könnte"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "23b21ff1-cd9d-412d-aa03-f9d580788a90",
                                "sense_id": "2deee2f8-ffad-397f-94b5-71e139506ea2",
                                "text": "„Sie hatte damals ein dunkles Vorgefühl dafür gehabt, dass dieser Zustand der Freiheit und des Aufgeschlossenseins für alle Freuden nie wiederkehren werde, und dieses Vorgefühl hatte recht behalten.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "32f89fd5-4095-4091-9eae-c579aa27d388",
                                "sense_id": "2deee2f8-ffad-397f-94b5-71e139506ea2",
                                "text": "„Doch daß es möglich war, nichts mehr zu erleben, hatte er nicht in Betracht gezogen in seinem Vorgefühl von Triumph.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e2a1eb2b-9253-4350-82fe-528ef62ce3b4",
                        "source_entry_id": "f73c82d1-47b2-335e-9d1e-7974e9e85ca2",
                        "source_sense_id": "2deee2f8-ffad-397f-94b5-71e139506ea2",
                        "source_sense_description": "Ahnung/Gefühl dafür, was später sein könnte",
                        "target_lang_word": "presentiment",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "presentiment",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "970eea35-7e2a-30ca-a218-f022f4e77132",
                                        "entry_id": "bc4442c7-9f1f-34dc-869a-9d6f47ae790c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A premonition; a feeling that something, often of undesirable nature, is going to happen."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b3c1e754-cdfe-4cdd-8806-108e5b5c5723",
                                                "sense_id": "970eea35-7e2a-30ca-a218-f022f4e77132",
                                                "text": "This unfortunate accident has upset me. I have a horrible presentiment that something of the kind may happen to me."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f1b4dd20-bc4c-4e84-866e-af1e1c279374",
                                                "sense_id": "970eea35-7e2a-30ca-a218-f022f4e77132",
                                                "text": "A man, my good Sir, has seldom an offer of kindness to make to a woman, but she has a presentiment of it some moments before."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7ccfbda7-4fa4-4cb4-98fc-7728ef51189a",
                                                "sense_id": "970eea35-7e2a-30ca-a218-f022f4e77132",
                                                "text": "A thousand alarming presentiments of evil to her beloved Catherine from this terrific separation must oppress her heart with sadness, and drown her in tears for the last day or two of their being together; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4862dda8-8846-4947-9aa0-688d97eb25a2",
                                                "sense_id": "970eea35-7e2a-30ca-a218-f022f4e77132",
                                                "text": "Oh, those women! They nurse and cuddle their presentiments, and make darlings of their ugliest thoughts, as they do of their deformed children."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "631c577f-1ef9-42d1-83ff-81c9a8fffce8",
                                                "sense_id": "970eea35-7e2a-30ca-a218-f022f4e77132",
                                                "text": "“No,” replied the girl, “it would not be strange, of course; but for some inexplicable reason I have one of those foolish feminine presentiments that all is not right with Mr. Caldwell. It is the strangest feeling—it is as though I knew that he was not on board the ship.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2a0d91ae-661f-4522-9da2-ef057cea74ac",
                                                "sense_id": "970eea35-7e2a-30ca-a218-f022f4e77132",
                                                "text": "I had a presentiment that this would be my last journey to the Continent for many a long day to come; this, as events turned out, proved all too correct. [This was published posthumously, the author died on 19 November 1942.]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a5e15391-a7d7-4fff-a3f1-ee9810fedcf5",
                                                "sense_id": "970eea35-7e2a-30ca-a218-f022f4e77132",
                                                "text": "Everything on the surface appeared to be just as it ought to be. And yet Constantin Demiris still felt that vague sense of unease, a presentiment of trouble."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b04045b4-045a-46df-860d-fb58223fcf5c",
                        "source_entry_id": "f73c82d1-47b2-335e-9d1e-7974e9e85ca2",
                        "source_sense_id": "2deee2f8-ffad-397f-94b5-71e139506ea2",
                        "source_sense_description": "Ahnung/Gefühl dafür, was später sein könnte",
                        "target_lang_word": "pressentiment",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pressentiment",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3fb4cc28-10a3-3dce-b7ec-d80af86f766d",
                                        "entry_id": "0add890f-9689-350e-a60a-f4a4e02aca8b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Intuition d'un événement à venir."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ba51e69a-0ba8-4dfc-ac0d-264543abec2d",
                                                "sense_id": "3fb4cc28-10a3-3dce-b7ec-d80af86f766d",
                                                "text": "Au reste, ses pressentiments ne l’avaient pas trompée, à peine avait-elle fait vingt lieues, que son mari avait été pris d’une fièvre cérébrale."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "75978f79-1208-4709-9a0f-06358d527fd1",
                                                "sense_id": "3fb4cc28-10a3-3dce-b7ec-d80af86f766d",
                                                "text": "Les bizarres pressentiments qui avaient si souvent agité Julie se trouvaient tout à coup réalisés."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "936a27df-492d-4cc1-9a13-ad29a79c30ee",
                                                "sense_id": "3fb4cc28-10a3-3dce-b7ec-d80af86f766d",
                                                "text": "La jeune fille s’était jetée toute vêtue sur son lit, l’inquiétude la tenait éveillée, un secret pressentiment l’avertissait de se tenir sur ses gardes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2f8fada5-8d5b-4d8a-9c46-24015a11f2c8",
                                                "sense_id": "3fb4cc28-10a3-3dce-b7ec-d80af86f766d",
                                                "text": "Nous trouvons ici de plus sombres pressentiments ; l’auteur se demande même si notre humanité atteindra sa véritable fin."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c46e7c3e-7637-4f77-a227-efe41ed9d163",
                                                "sense_id": "3fb4cc28-10a3-3dce-b7ec-d80af86f766d",
                                                "text": "Le cœur en émoi, secouée de pressentiments inquiets, Zaheira se vêtit et gagna le village voisin sur un âne."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4fda78b1-ca14-4070-b5d4-ee64a96d42d0",
                                                "sense_id": "3fb4cc28-10a3-3dce-b7ec-d80af86f766d",
                                                "text": "Le bruit, les allées et venues des gens m’alertèrent. J’accourus avec un funèbre pressentiment, sans toutefois penser à un malheur aussi terrible."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7a4fd7c1-2a9f-31d1-87c4-128cc82225c6",
                                        "entry_id": "0add890f-9689-350e-a60a-f4a4e02aca8b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Idée intuitive d'un concept qui sera ou non confirmé plus tard."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "63f73ef6-2b82-45eb-8880-720af62ae032",
                                                "sense_id": "7a4fd7c1-2a9f-31d1-87c4-128cc82225c6",
                                                "text": "Nous ne connaissons pas le contour précis de ce visage, ni sa réalisation concrète, nous en avons simplement le pressentiment."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
